OL,3,GNEWSAReview starting into 'overly
OL,4,Acomplex' taxi service
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review into the regulations around
OL,7,FJersey's "overly complex" taxi service
OL,8,Fhas begun, the island's infrastructure
OL,9,Fminister has confirmed.
OL,11,FDeputy Jonathan Renouf was answering
OL,12,Fquestions from Deputy Samantha Gleave
OL,13,Fabout the regulation of taxis in the
OL,14,Fisland.
OL,16,FShe wanted to understand whether the
OL,17,Frules could be simplified to reduce
OL,18,Fcosts, improve flexibility, support the
OL,19,Fnight-time economy and increase service
OL,20,Favailability.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
